            <p>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)"> </hi>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)"> 定</hi>
            </p>
            <p>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)">一切支丹宗門之儀者</hi>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)">是まで</hi>
            </p>
            <p>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)">御制禁之通堅く可相守候事</hi>
            </p>
            <p>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)">一邪宗門之儀者固く禁止之事</hi>
            </p>
            <p>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)"> 慶応四年三月</hi>
                <hi rend="color(#000000) background-color(#ffffff)"> 太政官</hi>
            </p>
